  - mud_event.h/c: registered eAUTOFLIGHT event (EVENT_CHAR) and event_autoflight handler.
  - act.movement.c: added flight_direction() helper (worldmap grid nav), fly_destinations[]
    config table (all map_tile stubs set to NOWHERE until P1 city placement),
    find_fly_dest() / find_fly_dest_by_interior() lookups, flight_data struct,
