[Jun 23 2026] - Henque
  worldmap zone 1000 — engine prerequisites and generation tooling:
  - Widened IDXTYPE from ush_int to uint32_t (structs.h) and added <stdint.h> to sysdep.h.
    NOWHERE/NOTHING/NOBODY/NOFLAG become 0xFFFFFFFF; all vnum typedefs widen automatically.
