[Jun 13 2026] - Henque
  Add the Fledgling "magic egg" card series (canon GI #35-43) in cards 65335-65343 /
  items 65435-65443: Athlete, Artist, Politician, Musician, Pilot, Novelist, Gambler,
  Actor, CEO. Each card transforms into an egg item you HOLD in hand; new C in limits.c
  point_update() (egg_incubation_update/hatch_fledgling_egg) counts game hours held in the
  WEAR_HOLD slot, and after 3 game hours the egg hatches and permanently raises (+1, capped
  at 25 via real_abils + affect_total + save_char) a random attribute from a profession-
  themed pool (Athlete STR/CON, Artist DEX/WIS, Politician CHA/INT, Musician DEX/CHA, Pilot
  DEX/CON, Novelist INT/WIS, Gambler WIS/INT, Actor CHA/DEX, CEO INT/CHA). Incubation must
  be continuous: not holding the egg resets the counter (C reset each tick + new REMOVE
  trigger 65434 osetval-resets on remove). This REPLACES the previous occupants of those
  slots (Turtle Mansion, Master Mime, Echo Recorder, Aqua Guard, Tornado Stand, Magnetic
  Rod, Water Divination Staff, Paladin's Prayer Beads; Fledgling Politician re-themed),
  and repoints zone 31's Mayor gift from 65339 to the Politician card 65337. New triggers
  kept vnum-ascending in 654.trg for real_trigger's binary search.
